  "title": "Smoky Salmon Spread",
  "description": "A simple but savory spread is made with canned salmon, cream cheese, green onion, and just a little smoke flavoring. Roll it into a ball to make a nice presentation, if you want. Serve with crackers.",
  "authors": [
